 3rd Approach (Optimal) using Dutch National Flag
       ## Main Point
 In the Dutch National Flag algorithm we assume that 0 to low -1 is containing zero, low to mid - 1 is containing 1
 and mid to high is unsorted and high + 1 to n - 1 is containing 2

 run while loop or any loop from mid to high
 while(mid >= high)
 {
  so mid value is equals to zero just swap it to low, then mid ++, low
  but mid value is 1 just mid ++
  but when mid value is 2 swap it to high and high --
 }

 This Approach has TC : O(n) and SC : O(3) => O(1)
